From: CC Stage2 <cc@iis.local>
Date: Wed, 29 Jul 2026 04:58:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] Support FAQ: remove from homepage, make it bold gold
 under Forums
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Ahmad's call: the FAQ should live only under Forums, and it should be
loud enough there that people actually click it.

- index.html: drop both Support FAQ links (desktop nav group, mobile menu).
  The homepage no longer references support-faq anywhere.
- forums/index.html: the subnav pill was font-weight 500 and var(--accent),
  which resolves to cyan #22e1ff in forums-tokens.css — it read as just
  another tab. Now 800-weight gold (--gold-hi) on a --gold-wash fill with a
  --gold-deep border and a --gold-glow ring, plus a "Commonly asked
  questions" title. Footer link bolded gold to match.
- forums/commons.html: nav + footer Support FAQ links bolded to --champ
  (that file defines its own gold scale).

Gates: site:hygiene green (164 HTML files, 0 missing refs) and the
held-release gate green (0 violations).

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TAEeWzAz1B7dHt85zVuk8C
